bb_tag\" >Yano Shizuka:</h2>The shy girl with black hair covering her eyes is like a faded flower when she is separated from the sister group, but when she is surrounded by her best friends, she blooms with incredible courage and vitality, as if she has a contradictory dual personality.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606920/extras/94fbabc3c2777ceefe04593cda73114e.avif?t=1746245362\" width=200 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20 sexy and erotic images of beautiful girls.<br></li><li>A fantastical erotic story with girls who have unique personalities.<br></li><li>You can skip the puzzles if you just want to enjoy the story. (Press Enter during a puzzle).<br></li><li>CG Gallery mode. (Click the left and right buttons next to the CG after completing a puzzle).</li></ul>",
